Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joe Frazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever see any of his fights against Ali?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Folk thought he got the title only because Ali was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But then he beat Ali in 1971.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good old Frazier.
